    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #286\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed to the existing branch `bb/relay-104-inbox-pipeline-05-07-transition-propos-thr_iind55yckf`.\n\n## Summary\n\nThis push adds the code-review fixes on top of the original implementation:\n\n- **[inbox-pipeline 05/07] Transition proposal status for deleted sources and validate envelopes** (`bc005d1`): implements `needsClarification`/`invalid` transitions, per-transition history logging, and destination-aware envelope validation in `semprec.tick`, per issue #104.\n- **Address code review** (`52b1340`): adds two test-coverage cases flagged as medium-severity findings on PR #286 — a `rejected`-status sibling to the existing \"confirmed proposal survives source deletion\" test, and a `needsClarification → proposed` round-trip test for an item that later gains a recognized type.\n\nVerified before pushing: `pnpm run build` (clean across all 7 backend workspace packages) and the full backend test suite (`vitest run`) — 23 test files, 294 tests, all passing.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
